  "result": "Perfect! All 69 tests pass (52 from before + 17 new tests).\n\n## Summary\n\nCreated invoice numbering functionality:\n\n**src/numbering.js** \u2014 `nextInvoiceNumber(existingNumbers, issueDate)`\n- Generates invoice numbers in format: INV-<year>-<4-digit counter>\n- Counter resets each year, starting at 0001\n- Extracts the year from issueDate and finds the highest counter for that year\n- Handles gaps in numbering and numbers from different years\n- Returns the next sequential number, zero-padded to 4 digits\n- Ignores malformed invoice numbers in the existing numbers array\n\n**src/invoices.js** \u2014 `issueInvoice(invoice, existingNumbers)`\n- Assigns a number to a draft invoice using nextInvoiceNumber()\n- Changes invoice status from 'draft' to 'issued'\n- Returns NOT_DRAFT error if invoice is not in draft status\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with the number set\n- Does not mutate the input invoice\n- Preserves all other invoice properties\n\n**Test coverage** \u2014 17 new tests:\n- **nextInvoiceNumber (10 tests):** Empty array, single/multiple numbers, different years, number ordering, large counters, malformed numbers, zero-padding\n- **issueInvoice (7 tests):** Number assignment, using existing numbers, multi-year handling, draft validation, non-mutation, property preservation, full workflow (create \u2192 modify \u2192 issue)\n\nAll 69 tests pass with no failures.",
